  15:hal_bsp/hal/driver/remote/sbus_ht10a.c ****  * channels_raw[5] 通道6: SWB-6  192/1792       两档
  16:hal_bsp/hal/driver/remote/sbus_ht10a.c ****  * channels_raw[6] 通道7: SWC-7  192/1792       两档
